0">Atendimento Especializado</span><h2>Corporativo</h2><p class="text-body">Soluções completas para empreiteiras, hospitais e restaurantes. Orçamentos personalizados com condições especiais para compras em atacado.</p><a class="hover:no-underline" href="https://eisku.com/Professionals" data-discover="true"><button type="button" class="flex items-center rounded-lg text-button transition-all disabled:opacity-35  py-3 px-5 text-white-100 border-solid border-1 border-white-100 hover:border-black-500 justify-between">Dowiedz się więcej</button></a></div></div></div><div class="lg:pl-10 pl-5 py-10"><div class="text-black-900"><div class="mb-10 bg-white-100 flex items-center justify-between"><h2>Dicas Técnicas</h2><a class="mr-6 md:mr-10 text-body" href="https://eisku.com/journal" data-discover="true">Przejdź do artykułów</a></div><div class="pb-10 overflow-x-auto scroll-thin overflow-y-hidden w-full"><div class="flex gap-7 flex-shrink-0 w-full"><div class="min-w-[310px] hidden md:block"></div><a class="block min-w-[310px] w-[310px] cursor-pointer hover:no-underline" href="https://eisku.com/journal/eisku-materials" data-discover="true"><img alt="" decoding="async" height="NaN" loading="lazy" src="images/product_esguicho_1787071652059.png" width="100" class="rounded-lg w-[310px] h-[310px] object-cover hover:rounded-3xl transition-all" style="width: 100%;"><p class="text-black-700 text-caption mt-6">29.01.2025</p><h3 class="mt-6 mb-6 min-h-[46px]">Vantagens do Aço Inox</h3><p class="text-body">Entenda por que o aço inox 304 é o padrão ouro na indústria de equipamentos, oferecendo resistência à corrosão, facilidade de limpeza e durabilidade inigualável.</p></a><a class="block min-w-[310px] w-[310px] cursor-pointer hover:no-underline" href="https://eisku.com/journal/minimalism-living-with-less-enjoying-more" data-discover="true"><img alt="" decoding="async" height="NaN" loading="lazy" src="images/product_clinica_1787071664056.png" width="100" class="rounded-lg w-[310px] h-[310px] object-cover hover:rounded-3xl transition-all" style="width: 100%;"><p class="text-black-700 text-caption mt-6">12.11.2024</p><h3 class="mt-6 mb-6 min-h-[46px]">Higiene em Cozinhas Industriais</h3><p class="text-body">Normas e boas práticas para evitar a contaminação cruzada e garantir um ambiente de trabalho seguro e eficiente utilizando equipamentos de ponta.</p></a><a class="block min-w-[310px] w-[310px] cursor-pointer hover:no-underline" href="https://eisku.com/journal/why-investing-in-wooden-furniture-is-worth-it" data-discover="true"><img alt="Wood table" decoding="async" height="NaN" loading="lazy" src="images/product_valvula_1787071672807.png" width="100" class="rounded-lg w-[310px] h-[310px] object-cover hover:rounded-3xl transition-all" style="width: 100%;"><p class="text-black-700 text-caption mt-6">22.08.2024</p><h3 class="mt-6 mb-6 min-h-[46px]">A Importância da Certificação</h3><p class="text-body">Conheça as certificações de segurança e qualidade que nossos produtos possuem e por que elas são fundamentais para o sucesso do seu empreendimento.</p></a><a class="block min-w-[310px] w-[310px] cursor-pointer hover:no-underline" href="https://eisku.com/journal/eco-friendly-packing" data-discover="true"><img alt="" decoding="async" height="NaN" loading="lazy" src="images/product_esguicho_1787071652059.png" width="100" class="rounded-lg w-[310px] h-[310px] object-cover hover:rounded-3xl transition-all" style="width: 100%;"><p class="text-black-700 text-caption mt-6">22.08.2024</p><h3 class="mt-6 mb-6 min-h-[46px]">Manutenção Preventiva</h3><p class="text-body">Dicas essenciais para prolongar a vida útil de seus esguichos e torneiras, evitando vazamentos e garantindo a máxima economia de água.</p></a></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:p-10 p-5"><div class="flex justify-between items-start about-container flex-wrap lg:pb-18 lg:pt-13"><div class="w-full lg:w-[310px] justify-center lg:justify-normal self-end lg:block flex gap-4 lg:gap-0"><div class="mb-7 mt-12 about-img about-img-1 lg:max-h-full lg:mt-0"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="images/product_clinica_1787071664056.png" width="100" style="width: 100%;"></div><div class="mb-12 mt-7 about-img about-img-2 lg:max-h-full"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="images/product_valvula_1787071672807.png" width="100" style="width: 100%;"></div></div><div class="lg:w-[310px] w-full text-black-900 flex flex-col gap-6 self-center"><p class="text-caption text-black-700 text-center">Sobre Nós</p><h2 class="text-center">Somos uma empresa líder em soluções hidráulicas profissionais, focada na alta performance e confiabilidade.</h2><p class="text-center text-body">Desenvolvemos produtos robustos projetados especificamente para suportar o rigor de cozinhas industriais e hospitais.</p><a class="hover:no-underline m-auto" href="https://eisku.com/about-us" data-discover="true"><button class="flex items-center rounded-lg text-button transition-all disabled:opacity-35  py-3 px-5 text-black-900 border-solid border-1 border-black-400 hover:border-[#08254D] justify-between">Dowiedz się więcej</button></a></div><div class="w-full lg:w-[310px] justify-center lg:justify-normal self-start lg:block flex gap-4 lg:gap-0 mt-5 lg:mt-0"><div class="mb-7 mt-12 about-img about-img-3 lg:max-h-full lg:mt-0"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="images/product_esguicho_1787071652059.png" width="100" style="width: 100%;"></div><div class="mb-12 mt-7 about-img about-img-4 lg:max-h-full"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="images/product_clinica_1787071664056.png" width="100" style="width: 100%;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-green-600 pt-6 pb-6 px-5 lg:px-10 lg:min-h-screen flex flex-col lg:justify-end"><div class="text-body text-white-100 flex justify-between mt-10 items-center"><span></span><a class="flex gap-1 items-center hover:no-underline hover:text-white-400 transition-all" href="https://www.instagram.com/eisku_fu